   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10D;n&#xFD;ch vec&#xED; a eur&#xF3;pskych z&#xE1;le&#x17E;itost&#xED; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global education project &quot;It is our home too&quot; part II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt glob&#xE1;lneho rozvojov&#xE9;ho vzdel&#xE1;vania &quot;Aj my sme tu doma II&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Main purpose of the project is supporting youth education and training in the area of migration and increasing awareness of migration related issues of elementary school students in Slovakia. Goals include dispelling prejudices and stereotypes and increasing public tolerance toward foreigners in Slovakia without acts of xenophobia and discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;&#xDA;&#x10D;elom projektu je podpora v&#xFD;chovy a vzdel&#xE1;vania det&#xED; a ml&#xE1;de&#x17E;e v oblasti migr&#xE1;cie a zv&#xFD;&#x161;enie povedomia u &#x17E;iakov Z&#x160; o tejto problematike na Slovensku. Cie&#x13E;om projektu je odstra&#x148;ovanie predsudkov a stereotypov a t&#xFD;m dosiahnu&#x165; vy&#x161;&#x161;iu mieru tolerancie vo&#x10D;i cudzincom na Slovensku bez prejavov xenof&#xF3;bie a diskrimin&#xE1;cie.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
